        "question": "Is the Axis Ace Credit Card worth it?",
        "answer": "Yes, the Axis Ace Credit Card is still a good cashback card for utility bill payments through Google Pay and everyday spending. It also offers unlimited 1.5% cashback on most eligible transactions."
      },
      {
        "question": "What is the annual fee of the Axis Ace Credit Card?",
        "answer": "The card charges an annual fee of ₹499 plus GST. The fee is waived if you spend ₹2 lakh or more in a card anniversary year."
